      "content": "This Integrated health services analysis – district and facility levels document from the Tookit for analysis and use \nof routine health facility data was developed by Wendy Venter of the WHO Division Data, Analytics and Delivery \nfor Impact and independent consultants Yolanda Barbera, Robert Pond and Xavier Modol. \nContributions were provided by WHO staff members Ayoub Al-Jawaldeh, Eman Aly, Laura Anderson, Ali Ardalan, \nShona Dalal, Stefania Davia, Karapet Davtyan, Theresa Diaz, Henry Doctor, Karima Gholbzouri, Gulin Gedik, Jan \nGrevendonk, Quamrul Hasan, Nilmindi Hemachandra, Elizabeth Katw",
