      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Explains that institutional mortality data are often the only mortality source where civil registration is weak, while cautioning that they reflect the types of cases facilities receive. It stresses accurate cause-of-death recording using ICD coding.",
